# Agentic Delivery Orchestrator (ADOR) - example secrets file
# Copy to ".env" and fill in. The real ".env" is gitignored and must never be committed.
# Secrets are kept OUT of config.toml. On a server, prefer systemd EnvironmentFile=,
# an OS keyring, or CI/CD variables instead of a flat .env.

# ----- Forge access -----
# Optional if glab / gh are already authenticated on the host (ADOR rides the CLI auth).
# Set a token only for direct API calls or to run the forge CLI inside the container.
# GITLAB_TOKEN=
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# ----- Executor model provider -----
# Required by the executor (opencode / pi / codex) running inside the container.
# Provide the key(s) for whichever provider your chosen executor uses.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
